ile-element"/></a></span></td></tr><tr><td class="sidebar-content">
<div class="sidebar-list mw-collapsible mw-collapsed"><div class="sidebar-list-title" style="background:transparent;border-top:1px solid #aaa;text-align:center;;color: var(--color-base)">Basic concepts</div><div class="sidebar-list-content mw-collapsible-content hlist"><div style="text-align:center; margin:0.4em 0 0em;"><i>Output and measurement</i></div>
<p class="mw-empty-elt"><span class="mw-empty-elt"><link typeof="mw:Extension/section" about="#mwt6" data-mw='{"name":"section","attrs":{"begin":"Output"}}'/></span></p>
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Economic_growth" title="Economic growth">Growth</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Business_cycle" title="Business cycle">Business cycle</a>
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Financial_crisis" title="Financial crisis">Financial crisis</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Recession" title="Recession">Recession</a>
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Economic_depression" title="Economic depression">Depression</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/National_accounts" title="National accounts">National accounts</a>
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/System_of_National_Accounts" title="System of National Accounts">SNA</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gross_domestic_product" title="Gross domestic product">GDP</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gross_national_income" title="Gross national income">GNI</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Net_national_income" title="Net national income">NNI</a></li></ul></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Output_gap" title="Output gap">Output gap</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unemployment" title="Unemployment">Unemployment</a></li></ul>
<p class="mw-empty-elt"><span class="mw-empty-elt"><link typeof="mw:Extension/section" about="#mwt7" data-mw='{"name":"section","attrs":{"end":"Output"}}'/></span></p>
<div style="text-align:center; margin:0.4em 0 0em;"><i>Money and prices</i></div>
<p class="mw-empty-elt"><span class="mw-empty-elt"><link typeof="mw:Extension/section" about="#mwt8" data-mw='{"name":"section","attrs":{"begin":"Money"}}'/></span></p>
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Exchange_rate" title="Exchange rate">Exchange rate</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inflation" title="Inflation">Inflation</a>
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cost-push_inflation" title="Cost-push inflation">Cost-push</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deflation" title="Deflation">Deflation</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Demand-pull_inflation" title="Demand-pull inflation">Demand-pull</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disinflation" title="Disinflation">Disinflation</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Price_level" title="Price level">Price level</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shrinkflation" title="Shrinkflation">Shrinkflation</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stagflation" title="Stagflation">Stagflation</a></li></ul></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Interest_rate" title="Interest rate">Interest rate</a>
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Liquidity_trap" title="Liquidity trap">Liquidity trap</a></li></ul></li>
